    ∀ t : GL (Fin (a + a')) (AE F E), (At (evFin F v) ((t : Matrix (Fin (a + a')) (Fin (a + a')) (AE F E)) - 1) ∧
      ∀ z ∈ GlobalTheory.InertSph.latAt G.W v, (t : Matrix (Fin (a + a')) (Fin (a + a')) (AE F E)) *ᵥ z ∈ GlobalTheory.InertSph.latAt G.W v ∧
